OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old woman has been charged
OL,7,Fafter a police officer was shot in
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,11,Fhad approached two suspects at a bus
OL,12,Fstop in Angel Row shortly before 04:50
OL,13,FBST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe male officer remains in hospital
OL,16,Freceiving treatment, the force added.
OL,18,FAisha Zaman, of Collison Street, Hyson
OL,19,FGreen, has been charged with possession
OL,20,Fof a prohibited firearm and possession
OL,21,Fof that firearm with intent to commit
OL,22,Fan indictable offence.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
